        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🕰️ · Long-term couples · Guided audio · AI"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "You know each other by heart.<br><em>Rediscover each other anyway.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Over time, intimacy doesn't disappear, it repeats itself. Caresse breaks that cycle by generating audio experiences you would never have thought to suggest yourselves, different every single time."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                \n                <span class=\"inline\">Download for free</span>\n            </a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Available on iOS & Android · Free demos · Paid personalized sessions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "truth"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "What many couples experience"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Routine isn't a flaw.<br>It's just a starting point."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "truth-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">The problem</p>\n                \n                <p>You know what works, so you come back to it. But that comfort ends up smothering curiosity and the desire for surprise.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">The Caresse solution</p>\n                \n                <p>The AI creates the experience for you. No need for ideas, no negotiation. You configure your preferences, and something new appears.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">What changes</p>\n                \n                <p>You stop being the scriptwriters of your intimacy. You become participants, free to feel without having to manage everything.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "truth-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                \n                <p class=\"label\">What it doesn't replace</p>\n                \n                <p>Caresse doesn't replace the connection you've built. It enriches it, adding a layer of novelty to what you already know well.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "benefits"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "What Caresse brings"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Novelty without the work of finding it."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "In a long relationship, energy is often as scarce as ideas. Caresse handles both. And if time is what you're really short of, see <a href=\"/en/for-busy-couples/\" style=\"color:var(--primary-vibrant);font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;\">how to make time for intimacy when you're busy</a>."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "compare-note",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "For a change from your usual ritual, a <a href=\"/en/couples-game/\">couples game without cards</a> lets a voice guide a scenario created from your choices. You remain free to follow or skip each suggestion."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎲</div>\n                \n                <h3>The AI sets the scene</h3>\n                \n                <p>No more searching for ideas or waiting for the other to suggest something. You configure your current desires together, and Caresse generates something you didn't expect.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔊</div>\n                \n                <h3>Speaker or bluetooth speaker, within reach</h3>\n                \n                <p>Put down the phone, use the speaker or connect to a bluetooth speaker. The voice fills the room and guides both partners, without anyone having to hold the device.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔁</div>\n                \n                <h3>Never the same thing twice</h3>\n                \n                <p>Each session is generated on the fly by the AI. Even if you choose the same preferences, the experience will be different. Repetition is no longer possible.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">💬</div>\n                \n                <h3>Reconnect without the hard words</h3>\n                \n                <p>The session setup is a guided conversation about what attracts you today. In long relationships, these conversations are often missing. Caresse makes them natural.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "how"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How it works"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "A new experience in four steps."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "steps-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n                \n                <h3>Configure together</h3>\n                \n                <p>Browse options together: atmosphere, tone, intensity, dynamics. It's already a conversation about what you really want tonight.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n                \n                <h3>The AI generates your session</h3>\n                \n                <p>In a few minutes, Caresse creates a tailored experience. Unique, never heard before, built around your current preferences.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">03</div>\n                \n                <h3>Put down the phone, turn on the speaker</h3>\n                \n                <p>Use the speaker or connect to a bluetooth speaker. The voice guides both partners, hands free.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">04</div>\n                \n                <h3>Let yourself be surprised</h3>\n                \n                <p>Close your eyes. The voice takes over, creates the atmosphere, guides the tempo. You have nothing to decide, just to feel.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What you want to know"
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse really work when you know each other very well?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "That's exactly what it's designed for. Knowing each other well lets you configure precisely what attracts you. The AI builds on that foundation to generate something unexpected."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How to use Caresse together without headphones?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Place the phone on a nearby surface, use the speaker or connect to a bluetooth speaker. The voice guides both partners naturally, without anyone having to hold the device."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What if one of us is less enthusiastic than the other?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "That's often the starting situation. Configuring together and letting the voice take over allows the hesitant one to be carried along without having to \"make an effort.\" Immersion builds naturally."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does the content get repetitive over time?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No, that's structurally impossible. Each session is generated on the fly by the AI, even with the same preferences as input. You can use Caresse every week for years without ever hearing the same session."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can Caresse help get through a dry spell in the relationship?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes, and that's one of its most common uses. By removing the pressure of initiative and creating a neutral framework, Caresse allows you to reconnect naturally, without it feeling like a \"couple effort.\""
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How often should long-term couples use Caresse?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "There's no rule. Some couples use it as a monthly ritual, others during special moments like a romantic weekend. The important thing is that it remains a choice, not an obligation."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
